# For the computers' image (packages/computer/Dockerfile), the one image
# built from the repository root: the workspace's manifests, which pnpm reads
# to install, and the sources the computer package builds from. At the root
# rather than beside the Dockerfile, as Wrangler sends the Dockerfile on
# stdin, where Docker looks for no Dockerfile-specific ignore file.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!tsconfig.build.json
!*/*/package.json
!packages/computer
!packages/core
**/node_modules
**/dist
